[[File:Screenshot 119.png|thumb|214x214px|Post Alpha 2.7]]
Vegetoid gained small buffs over time. Starting out with 1/3 that would heal its owner for 3 HP upon death, Vegetoid gained its first buff in '''Alpha 2.7''', where its ATK was raised to 2. '''Beta 1.6''' buffed that further to 3, giving it its current 3/3 for 3G.

[[File:Updated Vegetoid.png|thumb|211x211px|Post Beta 1.6]]
'''Beta 5.3 '''gave it its first buff in its effect, healing 4 HP upon death instead of 3 HP. '''Beta 16.0''' buffed that further to 5 HP.

